                            </div>
                            <i class="bi-star-fill" style="color:orange"></i>    <b>Competitive Compensation</b>
                            <div style="margin-left:2%" class="mb-3">
                                Data engineering is one of the highest-paying tech roles, with average salaries often exceeding those of data scientists.
                            </div>
                        </div>
                    </div>
